# Loaded automatically by Vite for `npm run build`.
#
# The on-premise deployment serves this bundle from IIS while the API runs as its
# own process on port 5103, so the two are different origins and the API base has
# to be absolute. A relative "/api" would resolve against IIS and 404.
#
# Because this is absolute and points at localhost, the web admin is only usable
# from a browser on the machine running the API. Serving it to other devices on
# the LAN means changing this to that machine's address and adding the same
# origin to Cors__AllowedOrigins in the backend's .env.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5103/api
